    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546780/extras/c9cf5cf3db357122a70cb75f393c1896.avif?t=1721733844\" /></span><br>When her prince goes missing and her \u201chappily ever after\u201d starts to curdle, the princess Yasmina takes matters into her own hands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546780/extras/5acfe911332fa537a9bfd4a8b2dcafcf.poster.avif?t=1721733844\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546780/extras/5acfe911332fa537a9bfd4a8b2dcafcf.webm?t=1721733844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>YAZ is an action-packed rogue \u201cultra-light\u201d that sees you hack and slash your way through deadly handmaidens, assassins, demons, and djinns as you escape from your father\u2019s palace and confront the dark and powerful forces at work in the kingdom\u2026<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546780/extras/11043399d969461585275a6d50edcebc.poster.avif?t=1721733844\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546780/extras/11043399d969461585275a6d50edcebc.webm?t=1721733844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>So get ready to swing your daggers, hurl your fireballs, and spring some cartwheels as you level up your abilities, weapons, AND wardrobe!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546780/extras/7aaf49c841c67c86bfd5b753dedb07da.poster.avif?t=1721733844\" ><source src=\"https://shared.a